{"body":{"says":"The grade given to something said. The author's practice, which he calls using measures: when something is said it is given a measure, such as that it is not yet owned by the build structure, and a value, and graded, so that what matters is not forgotten and its words stay as they were said. A measure need not be concluded: it is there to reason with, so that a session can say what is to be read and what is not. A brief may be measured too, as stale: the work has overtaken it, and it is marked rather than rewritten, so that no one is fooled by it."},"id":"1M6YBY3G000001D","instance":[],"mould":{"as":{"says":"What it is measured by: marked, as a reader marks a book; complementary, adding to what the briefs hold; verbatim; or stale, a brief the work has overtaken, its note saying what no longer holds and what still does.","shape":"string"},"by":{"holds":false,"says":"The voice that measured it.","shape":"ref"},"note":{"optional":true,"says":"Why it was marked, in a few words: a note in the margin, written with curiosity rather than as one who knows what is good.","shape":"string"},"of":{"holds":false,"says":"What was said that is measured: a whole, as a session, an utterance, a paragraph or a sentence; with a range, the whole the run lies within. Or a brief, where it is measured stale.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"owned":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The brief that already holds what was said, where the structure owns it; unsaid where nothing built owns it yet.","shape":{"set":"ref"}},"range":{"optional":true,"says":"Where the mark falls on a run of the whole's parts rather than the whole: from the first part to the last, in the whole's order.","shape":{"from":"ref","to":"ref"}},"thread":{"holds":false,"optional":true,"says":"The thread that takes it in, where one does.","shape":"ref"},"value":{"says":"Its grade: 3 not to be forgotten, 2 steers what is built, 1 noted. A scale for now, the author's to change. For stale: 3 would mislead whoever builds on it, 2 a part overtaken, 1 a detail.","shape":"number"}},"name":"measure"}
